<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Studio Calx | Web Direction Studio</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Studio Calxは、AIをはじめとする新しい制作ツールを活用した、WEBサイト制作チームです。思考を整理し、価値を正しく形にします。">

  <!-- OGP -->
  <meta property="og:title" content="Studio Calx | Web Direction Studio">
  <meta property="og:description" content="イメージを具体化と伝えたい情報を明確化">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://studio-xavier-site.vercel.app/">
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="Studio Calx">

  <!-- Twitter Card -->
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="Studio Calx | Web Direction Studio">
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="イメージを具体化と伝えたい情報を明確化">

  <!-- フォント読み込み (Cinzel + Noto Sans JP) -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@600;700&family=Noto+Sans+JP:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    /* 基本設定＆リセット */
    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }
    
    body {
      background-color: #0a0b0d;
      color: #f0f2f5;
      font-family: 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      line-height: 1.8;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      transition: background-color 0.2s ease-out;
    }

    section {
      scroll-margin-top: 80px;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 960px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 1.5rem;
    }

    /* 本文強調の解除：自然なウェイトと色に調整 */
    b, strong {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    /* 追従ヘッダーナビゲーション */
    .site-header {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      z-index: 100;
      background: rgba(10, 11, 13, 0.85);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .header-inner {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      height: 65px;
    }

    .header-logo {
      font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    }

    .header-nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .header-nav a {
      color: #cccccc;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: color 0.25s ease;
    }

    .header-nav a:hover {
      color: #c5a059;
    }

    .header-nav .nav-btn {
      padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
      border: 1px solid #c5a059;
      color: #c5a059;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }

    .header-nav .nav-btn:hover {
      background: #c5a059;
      color: #000000;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .header-nav a:not(.nav-btn) {
        display: none;
      }
    }

    /* 共通タイポグラフィ */
    .section-label {
      color: #c5a059;
      font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #ffffff;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.82rem 1.6rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: none;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: #c5a059;
      color: #000000;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: #d4af66;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
      color: #ffffff;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      border-color: #c5a059;
      color: #c5a059;
      background: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.1);
    }

    /* 1. HERO SECTION */
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      padding: 11rem 0 7rem;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      overflow: hidden;
      min-height: 70vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .hero-bg-container {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      z-index: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .hero-bg-img {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      opacity: 0;
      filter: brightness(22%) contrast(115%);
      transition: opacity 1.8s ease-in-out;
    }

    .hero-bg-img.active {
      opacity: 1;
    }

    .hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      max-width: 820px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .brand-title {
      font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
      font-size: calc(2.4rem + 2vw);
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin: 0.5rem 0 1.5rem;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, #b3b3b3 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    .hero-nav-grid {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.8rem;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 2.2rem;
    }

    /* 2. ABOUT SECTION */
    .about-section {
      padding: 6rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      position: relative;
      background: linear-gradient(rgba(10, 11, 13, 0.88), rgba(10, 11, 13, 0.88)), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497366216548-37526070297c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
    }

    .about-box-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1.4rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    .about-box {
      background: rgba(20, 24, 33, 0.7);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 2.2rem 2.4rem;
    }

    .about-box-title {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #c5a059;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    }

    .about-box-text {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.85;
      color: #d0d0d0;
      margin: 0;
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    /* 3. COMPARE SECTION */
    .compare-section {
      padding: 6rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      position: relative;
    }

    .compare-table-wrapper {
      margin-top: 2rem;
      overflow-x: auto;
    }

    .compare-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      text-align: left;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .compare-table th, .compare-table td {
      padding: 1.2rem 1.1rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      vertical-align: top;
    }

    .compare-table th {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-weight: 700;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .compare-table td.highlight {
      background: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.08);
      color: #f0f2f5;
    }

    .compare-tag-old {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      color: #aaaaaa;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      border-radius: 3px;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }

    .compare-tag-new {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
      background: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.25);
      color: #c5a059;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-radius: 3px;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }

    /* 4. SERVICES SECTION */
    .services-section {
      padding: 6rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .services-grid-2x2 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 1.8rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .services-grid-2x2 {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    .service-card-visual {
      background: rgba(20, 24, 33, 0.6);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .service-card-visual:hover {
      border-color: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.5);
      transform: translateY(-3px);
    }

    .service-card-img-box {
      width: 100%;
      height: 140px;
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }

    .service-card-img-box img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      filter: brightness(75%);
      transition: filter 0.3s ease;
    }

    .service-card-visual:hover .service-card-img-box img {
      filter: brightness(90%);
    }

    .service-card-body {
      padding: 1.6rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      flex-grow: 1;
    }

    .service-num {
      color: #c5a059;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
      font-size: 1rem;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }

    .service-card-title {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #ffffff;
      margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
    }

    .service-card-desc {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #b0b0b0;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin: 0;
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    /* 4.5. PRICE GUIDE SECTION */
    .price-section {
      padding: 6rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      background: rgba(15, 18, 25, 0.4);
    }

    .price-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    .price-card {
      background: rgba(20, 24, 33, 0.7);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 1.8rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      transition: border-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
    }

    .price-card:hover {
      border-color: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.6);
      transform: translateY(-3px);
    }

    .price-card-title {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #ffffff;
      margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    }

    .price-amount {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #c5a059;
      font-family: 'Cinzel', sans-serif;
      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      padding-bottom: 0.8rem;
    }

    .price-details {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: #b0b0b0;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .price-details p {
      margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    }

    .price-details strong {
      color: #c5a059;
      display: block;
      margin-top: 0.6rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
    }

    .price-note {
      margin-top: 2rem;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #888888;
      text-align: left;
    }

    /* 5. DEMOS SECTION */
    .demos-section {
      padding: 6rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .demo-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.8rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    .demo-card {
      background: rgba(20, 24, 33, 0.6);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      transition: transform 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease;
    }

    .demo-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      border-color: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.5);
    }

    .demo-img-wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      height: 170px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      position: relative;
    }

    .demo-img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      filter: brightness(80%);
      transition: transform 0.4s ease, filter 0.4s ease;
    }

    .demo-card:hover .demo-img {
      transform: scale(1.05);
      filter: brightness(100%);
    }

    .demo-body {
      padding: 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      flex-grow: 1;
    }

    .demo-badge {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: #c5a059;
      font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .demo-title {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      margin: 0 0 0.8rem;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .demo-desc {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #a0a0a0;
      line-height: 1.6;
      flex-grow: 1;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .demo-link {
      color: #c5a059;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .demo-card.hidden-demo {
      display: none;
    }

    /* 6. HOW WE WORK SECTION */
    .work-section {
      padding: 6rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .step-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    .step-item {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      background: rgba(20, 24, 33, 0.5);
      padding: 1.6rem;
      border-left: 3px solid #c5a059;
      border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
    }

    .step-num {
      font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: #c5a059;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    /* 7. CONTACT SECTION */
    .contact-section {
      padding: 6rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .tab-group {
      display: inline-flex;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      margin-top: 1.2rem;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      padding: 0.3rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }

    .tab-btn {
      padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 4px;
      background: transparent;
      color: #ffffff;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-family: 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;
    }

    .tab-btn.active {
      background: #c5a059;
      color: #000000;
    }

    .contact-form-box {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1.2rem;
      background: rgba(20, 24, 33, 0.6);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      padding: 2rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    .form-group label {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
      color: #cccccc;
    }

    .form-control {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0.8rem;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      border-radius: 4px;
      color: #ffffff;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: inherit;
    }

    select.form-control option {
      background: #111111;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    /* 8. NOTE ARCHIVES SECTION */
    .note-section {
      padding: 6rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .note-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    .note-card {
      background: rgba(20, 24, 33, 0.6);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 1.4rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #ffffff;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      transition: border-color 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease;
    }

    .note-card:hover {
      border-color: #c5a059;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .note-card-date {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: #c5a059;
      font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    /* 9. FOOTER */
    .site-footer {
      padding: 2.5rem 0;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #888888;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .footer-content {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- 固定上部ヘッダー（PRICEナビ導線を追加） -->
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container header-inner">
      <a href="#" class="header-logo">STUDIO CALX</a>
      <nav class="header-nav">
        <a href="#about">ABOUT</a>
        <a href="#why">WHY CALX</a>
        <a href="#services">SERVICES</a>
        <a href="#price">PRICE</a>
        <a href="#demos">MODELS</a>
        <a href="#work">FLOW</a>
        <a href="#contact" class="nav-btn">お問い合わせ</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- 1. HERO SECTION -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg-container">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555066931-4365d14bab8c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=80" alt="Web Development" class="hero-bg-img active">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581291518633-83b4ebd1d83e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=80" alt="UI Design & Prototyping" class="hero-bg-img">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1498050108023-c5249f4df085?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=80" alt="Digital Workspace" class="hero-bg-img">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507238691740-187a5b1d37b8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=80" alt="Creative Design Studio" class="hero-bg-img">
    </div>

    <div class="container hero-content">
      <p style="color: #c5a059; font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; letter-spacing: 0.25em; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        DESIGNED FOR YOUR BUSINESS
      </p>
      <h1 class="brand-title">STUDIO CALX</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.6; color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 1.2rem;">
        イメージを具体化と伝えたい情報を明確化
      </p>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #b0b0b0; margin: 0 auto 2rem; max-width: 620px;">
        Studio Calx：スタジオ・カルクスは、AIをはじめとする新しい制作ツールを活用した、WEBサイト制作チームです。
      </p>
      
      <!-- LP導線ナビゲーション -->
      <div class="hero-nav-grid">
        <a href="#about" class="btn btn-secondary">ディレクションとは</a>
        <a href="#demos" class="btn btn-primary">モデルサイトを見る</a>
        <a href="#work" class="btn btn-secondary">制作の流れ</a>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-secondary">ご相談・お問い合わせ</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2. ABOUT SECTION -->
  <section id="about" class="about-section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 800px;">
      <span class="section-label">ABOUT</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">スタジオカルクス＝ディレクションスキル✕AIによる開発と構築</h2>

      <div class="about-box-group">
        <div class="about-box">
          <h3 class="about-box-title">ディレクションとは</h3>
          <p class="about-box-text">
            ディレクションとは、一言で言えば制作の「現場監督」。何を創るか、全体の構成を考え、予算、スケジュール、品質をコントロールする役割を担います。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-box">
          <h3 class="about-box-title">スタジオカルクスとは</h3>
          <p class="about-box-text">
            スタジオカルクスを一言で説明すると、じゃじゃ馬AIを乗りこなす調教師です。これまでWEB・紙の制作会社でディレクターとして携わってきた経験とノウハウと、生成AIを始めとした新しい武器を融合させます。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-box">
          <h3 class="about-box-title">スタジオカルクスができること</h3>
          <p class="about-box-text">
            最先端のAIとはいえ、凄まじい爆発力と可能性を秘めている一方で、制御が難しく、振り回されることも多い「発展途上のテクノロジー」なんです。間違った方向に暴走しないように、ディレクションし、レイアウトすることで、柔軟なデザイン性と表現力を兼ね備えたホームページを制作します。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

